{
  "sections": {
    "hero_hop": {
      "type": "montibello-image-banner",
      "blocks": {},
      "block_order": [],
      "name": "Banner Montibello",
      "settings": {
        "layout": "full",
        "section_width": "full-width",
        "bundled_image": "montibello-hop-hero-desktop.jpg",
        "image_alt": "Campaña Montibello HOP",
        "toggle_overlay": false,
        "padding-block-start": 0,
        "padding-block-end": 0
      }
    },
    "intro_hop": {
      "type": "section",
      "blocks": {
        "intro_group": {
          "type": "group",
          "settings": {
            "content_direction": "column",
            "gap": 16,
            "width": "custom",
            "custom_width": 50,
            "width_mobile": "fill",
            "height": "fit"
          },
          "blocks": {
            "heading": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<h1>HOP</h1>",
                "type_preset": "h1",
                "max_width": "none"
              }
            },
            "text": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Rutinas profesionales de nutrición, control del frizz y mantenimiento formuladas con biociencia de algas. Elige tu gama.</p>",
                "type_preset": "rte",
                "max_width": "none"
              }
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "heading",
            "text"
          ]
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "intro_group"
      ],
      "name": "Sección",
      "settings": {
        "section_width": "page-width",
        "background_color": "{{ settings.color_palette.background }}",
        "padding-block-start": 40,
        "padding-block-end": 40
      }
    },
    "wellbeing_hop": {
      "type": "montibello-image-banner",
      "blocks": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>Corrige los signos del bienestar capilar</h2>",
            "type_preset": "h2",
            "max_width": "normal",
            "padding-block-end": 12
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Impulsa el bienestar en el cabello con ingredientes cosméticos de alta eficacia.</p><p>Experiencia inmersiva de bienestar a través de la sensorialidad de texturas y fragancias.</p><p>Una gama ecorresponsable para el bienestar del cabello y del planeta.</p>",
            "type_preset": "rte",
            "max_width": "normal"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": ["heading", "text"],
      "name": "Banner Montibello",
      "settings": {
        "layout": "split",
        "media_position": "left",
        "section_width": "full-width",
        "bundled_image": "montibello-hop-wellbeing-editorial.jpg",
        "image_alt": "Montibello HOP — bienestar capilar",
        "toggle_overlay": false,
        "padding-block-start": 0,
        "padding-block-end": 0
      }
    },
    "technology_hop": {
      "type": "montibello-image-banner",
      "blocks": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>LifeAlgae BioScience multiplica x4 el poder de los activos</h2>",
            "type_preset": "h2",
            "max_width": "normal",
            "padding-block-end": 12
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>5 años de investigación para desarrollar LifeAlgae BioScience, la biociencia basada en el poder de las algas capaz de amplificar y potenciar el poder de los activos. La clave: la hiperfermentación de las algas. Un proceso biotecnológico transformador único.</p>",
            "type_preset": "rte",
            "max_width": "normal"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": ["heading", "text"],
      "name": "Banner Montibello",
      "settings": {
        "layout": "split",
        "media_position": "right",
        "section_width": "full-width",
        "bundled_image": "montibello-hop-lifealgae-technology.jpg",
        "image_alt": "LifeAlgae BioScience — biociencia de algas Montibello HOP",
        "toggle_overlay": false,
        "padding-block-start": 0,
        "padding-block-end": 0
      }
    },
    "results_hop": {
      "type": "montibello-stats-panel",
      "blocks": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>Resultados</h2>",
            "type_preset": "h2",
            "max_width": "normal"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": ["heading"],
      "name": "Panel de datos HOP",
      "settings": {
        "bundled_image": "montibello-hop-results-editorial.jpg",
        "image_alt": "Montibello HOP — resultados verificados",
        "media_position": "left",
        "toggle_label": "Ver datos",
        "stat_1_number": "+93%",
        "stat_1_label": "más hidratación",
        "stat_2_number": "+87%",
        "stat_2_label": "más nutrición",
        "stat_3_number": "x6",
        "stat_3_label": "más fuerza",
        "stat_4_number": "+8",
        "stat_4_label": "semanas de color protegido",
        "footnote": "",
        "bundled_file": "none",
        "file_label": "",
        "section_width": "full-width",
        "padding-block-start": 0,
        "padding-block-end": 0
      }
    },
    "subfamilies_hop": {
      "type": "montibello-product-teaser",
      "blocks": {
        "ultra_repair": {
          "type": "product-teaser-card",
          "settings": {
            "bundled_image": "montibello-hop-subfamily-ultra-repair.jpg",
            "title": "Ultra Repair",
            "text": "Reparación intensiva para cabellos dañados",
            "link": "shopify://collections/hop-ultra-repair"
          }
        },
        "colour_last": {
          "type": "product-teaser-card",
          "settings": {
            "bundled_image": "montibello-hop-color-last-shampoo.png",
            "title": "Colour Last",
            "text": "Protección y prolongación del color",
            "link": "shopify://collections/hop-colour-last"
          }
        },
        "smooth_hydration": {
          "type": "product-teaser-card",
          "settings": {
            "bundled_image": "montibello-hop-subfamily-smooth-hydration.jpg",
            "title": "Smooth Hydration",
            "text": "Hidratación y control del frizz",
            "link": "shopify://collections/hop-smooth-hydration"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "ultra_repair",
        "colour_last",
        "smooth_hydration"
      ],
      "name": "Vitrina de productos",
      "settings": {
        "heading": "Elige tu gama HOP",
        "section_width": "full-width",
        "background_color": "#F6F6F3",
        "padding-block-start": 56,
        "padding-block-end": 56
      }
    },
    "cta_professional_hop": {
      "type": "section",
      "blocks": {
        "group_row": {
          "type": "group",
          "settings": {
            "content_direction": "row",
            "vertical_on_mobile": true,
            "horizontal_alignment": "space-between",
            "vertical_alignment": "center",
            "gap": 32
          },
          "blocks": {
            "group_professional": {
              "type": "group",
              "settings": {
                "content_direction": "row",
                "vertical_on_mobile": true,
                "vertical_alignment": "center",
                "gap": 24,
                "width": "fill"
              },
              "blocks": {
                "heading": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>¿Tienes un salón pero no eres cliente todavía?</p>",
                    "type_preset": "h5",
                    "text_color": "#FFFFFF",
                    "max_width": "normal"
                  }
                },
                "button": {
                  "type": "button",
                  "settings": {
                    "label": "Contacta con un comercial",
                    "link": "/pages/contacto",
                    "style_class": "button-custom",
                    "custom_button_background": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
                    "custom_button_text": "#FFFFFF",
                    "custom_button_border": "#FFFFFF"
                  }
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "heading",
                "button"
              ]
            },
            "group_locator": {
              "type": "group",
              "settings": {
                "content_direction": "row",
                "vertical_on_mobile": true,
                "vertical_alignment": "center",
                "gap": 24,
                "width": "fill"
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Localiza tu salón o peluquería Montibello más cercana</p>",
                    "type_preset": "h5",
                    "text_color": "#FFFFFF",
                    "max_width": "normal"
                  }
                },
                "button": {
                  "type": "button",
                  "settings": {
                    "label": "Encuentra",
                    "link": "/pages/contacto",
                    "style_class": "button-custom",
                    "custom_button_background": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
                    "custom_button_text": "#FFFFFF",
                    "custom_button_border": "#FFFFFF"
                  }
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text",
                "button"
              ]
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "group_professional",
            "group_locator"
          ]
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "group_row"
      ],
      "name": "Sección",
      "settings": {
        "section_width": "page-width",
        "background_color": "#000000",
        "padding-block-start": 56,
        "padding-block-end": 56
      }
    }
  },
  "order": [
    "hero_hop",
    "intro_hop",
    "wellbeing_hop",
    "technology_hop",
    "results_hop",
    "subfamilies_hop",
    "cta_professional_hop"
  ]
}
